00:11:17,647 --> 00:11:23,647
High Strung is a music, romance, drama film directed by Michael Damian.

3
00:16:56,470 --> 00:17:02,470
When a hip hop violinist busking in the New York subway encounters a classical dancer
on scholarship at the Manhattan Conservatory of the Arts, sparks fly.

4
00:22:35,294 --> 00:22:41,294
With the help of a hip hop dance crew they must find a common ground while
preparing for a competition that could change their lives forever.

5
