9
00:50:49,411 --> 00:50:55,411
Kyle, played by Richard Southgate.

10
00:56:28,235 --> 00:56:34,235
Kramrovsky, played by Paul Freeman.

11
01:02:07,058 --> 01:02:13,058
High Strung is a 2016 American drama film directed by Michael
Damian and written by Janeen Damian and Michael Damian.

12
01:07:45,882 --> 01:07:51,882
The film stars Keenan Kampa, Nicholas Galitzine, Jane Seymour,
Sonoya Mizuno, Richard Southgate, and Paul Freeman.

13
01:13:24,705 --> 01:13:30,705
The film was released on April 8, 2016, by Paladin.

14
01:19:03,529 --> 01:19:09,529
A sequel High Strung: Free Dance was released in 2019.

15
01:24:42,352 --> 01:24:48,352
The film explores themes of dance, violin, ballet, leotard.

16
01:30:21,176 --> 01:30:27,176
